  "slug": "mr-bigs-white-sangria",
  "name": "Mr. Big's White Sangria",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "Mr. Big's white sangria recipe creates a refreshing, tequila-spiked punch with citrus fruit, wine, and champagne, making it perfect for summer parties.",
  "cuisine": "Spanish",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Put oranges, lemons, and limes in a large punch bowl; pour sugar over fruit. Add tequila; stir gently with a wooden spoon. Set aside to soak 6 hours to overnight."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Add ice to the punch bowl; add white wine, Champagne, and club soda. Stir; serve immediately."
    }
  ],
